    "text": {
     "en": "(additional, not in the textbook) This lesson is extra to the shapes in Toy Joy. We compare numbers up to 99.\nA two-digit number has tens and ones. 45 is 4 tens and 5 ones.\nTo compare two numbers, look at the tens first. The number with more tens is greater.\n54 has 5 tens and 45 has 4 tens, so 54 is greater than 45.\nIf the tens are the same, compare the ones. 63 is greater than 61.\nUse the signs greater than and less than to write the answer."
    }
